//! rt-api (L5): the HTTP surfaces (docs/api.md).
//!
//! - [`control_router`] — `/v1/…` management API, `/v1/openapi.json`, Scalar at `/docs`;
//! - [`invoke_router`] — `ANY /s/{slug}/*` and host-based invocation (`rt-ingress` merged in the MVP);
//! - [`health_router`] — `/metrics`, `/healthz`, `/readyz`;
//! - [`ApiDoc`] — the OpenAPI document generated by `utoipa`.
//!
//! Layer rule: this crate must not depend on executors, `rt-build` parsing or `rt-host`. Upload
//! validation arrives through `rt_types::UploadValidator`; node facts through [`NodeInfo`].

#![allow(clippy::result_large_err)]
